WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:04.154
A personal invitation opens the
organization administrator's workspace.

00:00:04.154 --> 00:00:10.178
Harbor has two projects here, each with its
own tasks and progress.

00:00:11.227 --> 00:00:13.497
Open Harbor Lights Benefit Gala.

00:00:13.497 --> 00:00:16.576
Its board lists the guest arrival walk,

00:00:16.576 --> 00:00:21.115
the evening run of show, and the
participant's arrival confirmation.

00:00:22.164 --> 00:00:24.832
The floor lead has started the arrival
walk.

00:00:24.832 --> 00:00:27.500
Change its status to In progress and save.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.477
The count at the top of the board updates.

00:00:31.527 --> 00:00:34.795
Open Project CRM, then Add a contact.

00:00:34.795 --> 00:00:37.825
Record the program liaison and their
company,

00:00:37.825 --> 00:00:42.689
select the Contacted stage, and add the
record to this gala.

00:00:43.739 --> 00:00:46.938
Open the new record. Move it to Proposal,

00:00:46.938 --> 00:00:51.876
set the follow-up date, and add a note
about the revised floor plan.

00:00:51.876 --> 00:00:55.562
Save the changes to keep the project team
in sync.

00:00:56.612 --> 00:01:01.435
The contact now shows its new stage,
follow-up date, and project note.

00:01:01.435 --> 00:01:05.840
Return to the workspace or sign out when
the review is complete.
